<html>
 <head>
  <title></title>
 </head>
 <body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
              border-collapse:collapse;
              background-color:#ffffff;" width="100%">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td align="center" style="padding:0;">
      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:760px;
                              width:100%;
                              background-color:#ffffff;
                              border:2px solid #c9a75d;
                              border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
       <tbody>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:0;"><img alt="Arelia Email Banner Image" src="{[devName:Arelia_Email_Banner_Image]}" style="display:block;
                                           width:100%;
                                           max-width:100%;
                                           height:auto;
                                           border:0;" title="Arelia Email Banner Image" /></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:30px 34px 32px 34px;"><p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Dear Manager,</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">We have successfully revised the payment structure for the project <strong>{{OPPORTUNITY_NAME}}</strong>. The Supervisor has addressed the specific points raised in your previous review to ensure alignment with our internal guidelines.</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin-bottom:24px;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="background-color:#faf8f3;
                                                       border-left:3px solid #c9a75d;
                                                       padding:16px 18px;"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;
                                                          font-size:18px;
                                                          line-height:1.5;
                                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                          color:#222222;"><strong>Summary of Your Previous Feedback:</strong></p> <p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:18px;
                                                          line-height:1.5;
                                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                          font-style:italic;
                                                          color:#555555;">"{{MANAGER_REMARKS}}"</p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Please review the updated installments to confirm that all necessary corrections have been made. Your approval is required to proceed with presenting these final terms to the client.</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin:22px 0 24px 0;">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="background-color:#1b1b1b;
                                                       border:1px solid #c9a75d;
                                                       padding:12px 24px;
                                                       text-align:center;"><a href="{{APPROVAL_LINK}}" style="font-size:17px;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#ffffff;
                                                          text-decoration:none;
                                                          font-weight:bold;
                                                          display:inline-block;">Review &amp; Approve Terms </a></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
                                          font-size:16px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                          color:#777777;">If you require further adjustments, please use the "Request Changes" option in the link above.</p> <p style="margin:0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Best regards,<br /> <strong>Arelia Team.</strong></p></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td align="center" style="background-color:#171717;
                                       border-top:2px solid #C99A3D;
                                       padding:24px 32px 22px 32px;
                                       text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
                                          font-size:24px;
                                          line-height:1.3;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#D6B36A;
                                          font-weight:bold;
                                          text-align:center;">Arelia</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:11px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                          color:#C99A3D;
                                          letter-spacing:2px;
                                          text-align:center;">PREMIUM &amp; LUXURY INTERIOR DESIGNS</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td align="center" style="border-top:1px solid #6E5427;
                                                       padding-top:16px;
                                                       text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
                                                          font-size:11px;
                                                          line-height:1.6;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#8F887F;
                                                          text-align:center;">This email was sent because revised payment terms require your management review.</p> <p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:11px;
                                                          line-height:1.6;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#8F887F;
                                                          text-align:center;">© 2026 Arelia. All rights reserved.</p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table></td>
        </tr>
       </tbody>
      </table></td>
    </tr>
   </tbody>
  </table>
 </body>
</html>